Subject: [PATCH] Documentation: review of the READMEs

The READMEs were checked against the sources and the registered tests: requirements of the prototype branch of mfem-mgis instead of mfem-mgis@master, tests on the GPU and their conditions, MUMPS required by the simulations of ex8, NewtonK0 factorizing the elastic operator at each resolution, cuDSS with hypre on the host (memory of the host read by the GPU), default values of the options.
